title: parlament unionist coalition

You should not be here? Report a bug if you see this text.

@psc_cs
title: PSC-led <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="psc" data-summary="Minority government - [+ psc_parlament_s +]/[+ parlament_s_majority +]"><span style="color: var(--cs); font-style: italic;">Moderation</span> Government</span> with Cs support
view-if: parlament_coalition_psc_cs_mod_s > 0
choose-if: psc_parlament_s + cs_parlament_s >= parlament_s_majority
unavailable-subtitle: The PSC and Cs lack a majority to form this government.
subtitle: A government of supposed "reconciliation".
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_unionist_variant = "psc_cs_mod";
!}
go-to: form

@ppc_cs_psc_abst
title: PPC-led <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="ppc cs" data-summary="Minority government - [+ ppc_parlament_s + cs_parlament_s +]/[+ parlament_s_majority +]">Unity Pact</span> with PSC abstention
view-if: parlament_coalition_ppc_cs_psc_abst_s > 0
choose-if: ppc_parlament_s + cs_parlament_s + psc_parlament_s / 2 >= parlament_s_majority
