title: <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="[? if cs_parlament_s >= ppc_parlament_s: cs ppc?][? if cs_parlament_s < ppc_parlament_s: ppc cs?]" data-summary="Minority government - [+ cs_parlament_s + ppc_parlament_s +]/[+ parlament_s_majority +]"><span style="color: var(--cs); font-style: italic;">Right</span>-<span style="color: var(--vox); font-style: italic;">Union</span> Coalition</span> with Vox support
